 chat-first interface.</p><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-10" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="150"><div class="flex flex-col items-center p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-lg shadow-lg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wallet w-10 h-10 mx-auto text-primary mb-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 7V4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H5a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h15a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4h-3a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-2a1 1 0 0 0-1-1"></path><path d="M3 5v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h15a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-4"></path></svg><h3 class="font-semibold text-lg text-white mb-2">Solana-native onboarding</h3><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm text-center">Connect Phantom or Backpack, bridge USDC, and trade without leaving Telegram.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-lg shadow-lg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-left-right w-10 h-10 mx-auto text-primary mb-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 3 4 7l4 4"></path><path d="M4 7h16"></path><path d="m16 21 4-4-4-4"></path><path d="M20 17H4"></path></svg><h3 class="font-semibold text-lg text-white mb-2">Built-in bridging</h3><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm text-center">Route-optimized Solana → Polygon bridging with real-time status updates and alerts.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-lg shadow-lg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap w-10 h-10 mx-auto text-primary mb-4" aria-hidden="tru