ata-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="150" class="jsx-6d4c8b1dfa76261d grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 items-stretch"><div class="jsx-6d4c8b1dfa76261d flex flex-col items-stretch transform hover:-translate-y-3 transition-all duration-500"><div class="jsx-6d4c8b1dfa76261d flex flex-col h-full items-center gap-4 p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white/5 border backdrop-blur-lg shadow-lg transition-all duration-500 border-white/10"><div class="jsx-6d4c8b1dfa76261d text-5xl mb-2 transition-all duration-500 scale-100">🔐</div><h3 class="jsx-6d4c8b1dfa76261d text-xl font-bold text-white text-center">Non-custodial by default</h3><p class="jsx-6d4c8b1dfa76261d text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-center">Keys stay with you. Connect via Phantom/Backpack (Solana) or MetaMask/Rabby (Polygon).</p><div style="opacity:0;transform:translate(5px, 5px)" class="jsx-6d4c8b1dfa76261d absolute top-4 left-4 w-3 h-3 border-t-2 border-l-2 border-primary/30 transition-all duration-500"></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translate(-5px, -5px)" class="jsx-6d4c8b1dfa76261d absolute bottom-4 right-4 w-3 h-3 border-b-2 border-r-2 border-primary/30 transition-all duration-500"></div></div></div><div class="jsx-6d4c8b1dfa76261d flex flex-col items-stretch transform hover:-translate-y-3 transition-all duration-500"><div class="jsx-6d4c8b1dfa76261d flex flex-col h-full items-center gap-4 p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white/5 border backdrop-blur-lg shadow-lg transition-all duration-500 border-white/10"><div class="jsx-6d4c8b1dfa76261d text-5xl mb-2 transition-all duration-500 scale-100">✓</div><h3 class="jsx-6d4c8b1dfa76261d text-xl font-bold text-white text-center">Provider verification</h3><p class="jsx-6d4c8b1dfa76261d text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-center">All webhooks and bridge quotes verified with HMAC and domain allowlists. This ensures your interactions are secure and auditable.</p><div style="opacity:0;transform:translate(5px, 5px)" class="jsx-6d4c8b1dfa76261d absolute top-4 left-4 w-3 h-3 border-t-2 border-l-2 border-primary/30 transition-all duration-500"></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translate(-5px, -5px)" class="jsx-6d4c8b1dfa76261d absolute bottom-4 right-4 w-3 h-3 border-b-2 border-r-2 border-primary/30 transition-all duration-500"></div></div></div><div class="jsx-6d4c8b1dfa76261d flex flex-col items-stretch transform hover:-translate-y-3 transition-all duration-500"><div class="jsx-6d4c8b1dfa76261d flex flex-col h-full items-center gap-4 p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white/5 border backdrop-blur-lg shadow-lg transition-all duration-500 border-white/10"><div class="jsx-6d4c8b1dfa76261d text-5xl mb-2 transition-all duration-500 scale-100">⚡</div><h3 class="jsx-6d4c8b1dfa76261d text-xl font-bold text-white text-center">Rate limits &amp; circuit breakers</h3><p class="jsx-6d4c8b1dfa76261d text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-center">Built-in abuse protection and global fail-safes for external dependencies, making sure your transactions are smooth even under heavy load.</p><div style="opacity:0;transform:translate(5px, 5px)" class="jsx-6d4c8b1dfa76261d absolute top-4 left-4 w-3 h-3 border-t-2 border-l-2 border-primary/30 transition-all duration-500"></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translate(-5px, -5px)" class="jsx-6d4c8b1dfa76261d absolute bottom-4 right-4 w-3 h-3 border-b-2 border-r-2 border-primary/30 transition-all duration-500"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="faqs" class="jsx-cac78fc1a6c88419 relative bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0b0e1a] to-[#11182f] py-20 overflow-hidden"><div class="jsx-cac78fc1a6c88419 absolute inset-0"><div class="jsx-cac78fc1a6c88419 w-full h-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle,_rgba(255,255,255,0.06)_1px,_transparent_1px)] bg-[length:28px_28px] animate-[driftStars_80s_linear_infinite] opacity-30"></div><div class="jsx-cac78fc1a6c88419 absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,_rgba(42,86,253,0.12)_0%,_transparent_70%)]"></div></div><div cl